    "desc": "About us\nHi, we are Ten Square Games, and we live games! No, not a typo - but a level up from loving! We are on a mission of giving players excellent outdoor experiences on their mobiles. With global hits, such as Fishing Clash, we know how to make the best of technology, fun, and fair play. With 77 million registered players in 2025 and 300+ people on board, we keep growing and learning, having the insatiable hunger for the next success. If you also like to explore the unknown and know how to own it, we want to work with you!\n\nWhat is this job all about?\nWe're looking for an Influencer Marketing Manager to join our Growth Marketing team and help scale influencer marketing activities across Ten Square Games' portfolio of mobile games.\nIn this role, you'll be responsible for planning and executing influencer campaigns, building relationships with creators and agencies, and collaborating with internal teams and external partners to deliver high-quality campaigns that support business growth.",
