    "desc": "ABOUT VOODOO\n\nFounded in 2013, Voodoo is a tech company that creates mobile games and apps with a mission to entertain the world. Gathering 800 employees, 7 billion downloads, and over 200 million active users, Voodoo is the #3 mobile publisher worldwide in terms of downloads after Google and Meta. Our portfolio includes chart-topping games like Mob Control and Block Jam, alongside popular apps such as BeReal and Wizz.\n\n\n\n\nTEAM\n\nAt WeMoms, we understand the complexities of motherhood. More than an app, we're a guiding compass for mothers globally, making motherhood feel intuitive and supported.\nOur vision is to create an ever-present circle of trust, wisdom, and support for every mom. We deliver personalized, empowering guidance and resources to mothers at every stage of their journey.\nOur partnership with Voodoo, a global leader in mobile gaming and apps, propels us on a hyper-growth path. We are a passionate team of 30 professionals.\nAs we embark on this exciting growth phase, we're looking for a Community Manager to help us scale our social presence and create high-performing content.\n\n\n\n\nROLE\n\nWeMoms is looking for a Community Manager to join our Studio team and play a key role in shaping and growing our social media presence.\nYou will be at the intersection of content strategy and execution, ensuring that our platforms (Instagram, TikTok, etc.) deliver high-performing, relevant, and engaging content.\n\n\n\n\nKEY RESPONSIBILITIES\n\n\n\n\nCONTENT STRATEGY & IDEATION\n\n - Contribute to building and managing the editorial calendar\n\n - Propose engaging and potentially viral content concepts\n\n - Identify and leverage trends (formats, sounds, storytelling angles)\n\n - Source relevant high-performing content (UGC, videos, trends)\n\n\n\n\nSOCIAL MEDIA EXECUTION\n\n - Publish content across platforms (Instagram, TikTok, etc.)\n\n - Optimize posts based on platform best practices (formats, timing, hooks)\n\n - Adapt content to evolving algorithms and user behaviors\n\n\nPERFORMANCE & INSIGHTS\n\n - Track content performance (reach, engagement, watch time, etc.)\n\n - Analyze what works and what doesn’t\n\n - Provide actionable recommendations (formats, timing, angles)\n\n\n\n\nPROFILE\n\n - You have a first experience in community management (internship or apprenticeship included)\n\n - You are highly fluent in social media codes, especially TikTok and Instagram\n\n - You understand algorithms and engagement mechanics\n\n - You have a strong instinct for viral content and trends\n\n - You are curious, proactive, and constantly monitoring trends\n\n - You are organized and able to manage an editorial calendar\n\n - You enjoy analyzing performance and extracting insights\n\n - Native or Bilingual in French\n\n\n\n\nSKILLS & TOOLS\n\n - Comfortable with creative tools (Photoshop, Premiere Pro, After Effects is a plus)\n\n - Strong video editing skills (basic to advanced)\n\n - Familiar with AI tools for content ideation and optimization\n\n - Strong creative sensitivity (format, rhythm, storytelling)",
