    "desc": "About Us:\nReality Games is a fast-growing mobile gaming company with a focus on harnessing big data and AI to create immersive, location-based gaming experiences. We’re passionate about innovation, and we’re scaling globally with our latest project, Monopoly World.\n\nAbout the Project:\nMonopoly World is our bold re-imagining of the most iconic board game ever made, rebuilt for mobile and already captivating millions of players. We’re building a revolutionary, location-based mobile game based on the world’s strongest gaming IP — transforming the real world into a living, breathing game board. Players walk, buy, trade, and build real-world properties, powered by geolocation, real-time data, and AI personalization. Our mission is not just to adapt a famous brand, but to redefine how players experience the world around them. This means pioneering a complete sonic identity for a global franchise — something that has never been done before in this space.\n\nCheck out our trailer for the Monopoly World project:\niOS: https://apps.apple.com/pl/app/monopoly-world/id6451202232?l=pl\nAndroid: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=co.reality.monopolyworld&hl=en\n\nAbout the Role:\nLocation: Kraków – On-site (office only)\nContract: Full-time\n\nWe’re looking for a hands-on, fast-moving Performance Creative Producer who will manage the end-to-end production of performance ads for Monopoly World. This includes sourcing creators, purchasing ads, coordinating designers, giving feedback, and delivering high-quality assets for UA testing. This is a pure production role—operational, quick, and quality-driven.\nYou must be someone who thrives on speed and can get great ads produced within 24–48 hours.\n\nWhy this role matters?\nMonopoly World’s growth relies heavily on top-performing creatives.\nYour work will be directly responsible for scaling our global user acquisition.\nWork happens in our Kraków office alongside the creative, production, and UA teams.\n\nJoin us full-time at our stunning office located in the heart of Krakow! Situated in a historic building just steps away from the vibrant city center, our workspace blends timeless charm with modern amenities, providing an inspiring setting for your personal and professional growth.\n\nKey Responsibilities\n\n• Source UGC creators, editors, animators, and designers worldwide.\n• Negotiate pricing and deadlines for ad production.\n• Lead fast and effective calls with creators and production partners.\n• Give clear briefs and sharp, actionable feedback.\n• Evaluate creative quality — understanding what performs and why.\n• Coordinate designers, animators, video editors, and copywriters.\n• Manage deadlines, priorities, and delivery pipelines.\n• Work closely with User Acquisition on creative testing.\n• Maintain processes, templates, and structure for creative production.\n• Deliver assets in all required formats (Meta, TikTok, Google, Webshop).\n• Track trends in mobile gaming creatives and generate new ideas.",
