    "url": "https://careers.reality.co/o/social-media-community-live-ops-manager",
    "desc": "Work setup: hybrid (on-site preferred)\nContract: Full-time\nCompensation: negotiable\nNote: Polish and international candidates are welcome. (English C1 required; Polish not required)\n\nAbout us\nReality Metaverse is a Web3/GameFi ecosystem. We build and scale:\n\n• games (including Telegram mini-apps like Reality Rush),\n• WNFTs and the RMV token (utility, rewards, events),\n• a global community of players and investors (AMAs, contests, airdrops, referral campaigns).\nWe move fast, iterate with product/dev, and explain Web3 in a friendly way for newcomers.\n\nResponsibilities\nSocial Media (≈60%)\n\n• Plan and publish content on X, Telegram, Discord, YouTube/Shorts, TikTok, Instagram.\n• Editorial calendar, short copy (EN), collaboration with designers (briefs/feedback) and communication with moderators (pinning, hygiene, priorities).\n• Community moderation and quick responses (Q&A, pinned updates).\n• Basic analytics: reach, ER, channel growth, CTR (weekly/monthly reports).\n\nLive Ops / Community Events (≈40%)\n\n• Co-host AMAs, X Spaces, Discord Stages, livestreams (OBS/Restream — we’ll teach you).\n• Community activations: contests, quests/challenges, airdrops, mini-tournaments.\n• Operational support for drops/announcements (rules, anti-spam, prize allocation).\n• Collect feedback, maintain FAQ, surface quick wins to product.",
